{
  "title": "Kissed Smoky French Vegetable Curry",
  "description": "A pungent and light French-inspired curry featuring ginger garlic paste and binchotan-charcoal, perfect for the monsoon season, this dish is vegan-friendly and packed with flavor.",
  "cuisine": "French",
